The schemas in this repository are designed to align with the HL7 FHIR®
Genomics Implementation Guide and reference clinical evidence levels
defined by the AMP/ASCO/CAP somatic variant interpretation guidelines
(Li MM et al., J Mol Diagn 2017).

Implementations that integrate proprietary or third-party knowledge bases
(OncoKB, COSMIC, CIViC, NCCN, others) are responsible for their own
licensing, citation, and attribution obligations under the terms of those
sources. The open-source schema does not relicense or distribute content
from any of those bases; it provides an `evidence.externalLevels` extension
point for licensed implementations to populate.

